1
00:00:55,920 --> 00:00:56,719
Hello?

2
00:00:57,079 --> 00:00:58,159
Hello, Ms. Wang.

3
00:00:58,280 --> 00:01:00,119
I'm with Taotaobao customer service.

4
00:01:00,119 --> 00:01:02,000
My employee ID is 1198.

5
00:01:02,159 --> 00:01:03,320
I'm calling you today

6
00:01:03,320 --> 00:01:06,400
because the children's nutritional powder you bought

7
00:01:06,400 --> 00:01:07,519
might have some issues.

8
00:01:07,519 --> 00:01:10,359
What? There's an issue with the powder I bought?

9
00:01:10,359 --> 00:01:11,680
We are so sorry.

10
00:01:11,680 --> 00:01:13,599
Some levels in this batch exceed safety standards.

11
00:01:14,040 --> 00:01:14,760
First of all,

12
00:01:14,760 --> 00:01:16,319
I want to sincerely apologize to you.

13
00:01:16,319 --> 00:01:20,079
Our company is issuing returns and refunds to all customers,

14
00:01:20,079 --> 00:01:21,879
and providing triple compensation.

15
00:01:21,959 --> 00:01:25,200
Triple is still just over 1,000 yuan.

16
00:01:25,200 --> 00:01:28,319
True, that's not a lot of money to you.

17
00:01:28,319 --> 00:01:29,159
So at the same time,

18
00:01:29,159 --> 00:01:30,799
we are also gifting you a

19
00:01:30,799 --> 00:01:32,920
premium insurance policy worth 3,000 yuan.

20
00:01:32,920 --> 00:01:34,760
The coverage is 5 million.

21
00:01:37,200 --> 00:01:38,959
Thank God this one isn't born yet.

22
00:01:39,359 --> 00:01:41,120
Will it have any effect on my oldest child?

23
00:01:41,120 --> 00:01:41,959
No, it won't.

24
00:01:42,000 --> 00:01:42,920
Just to be safe,

25
00:01:42,920 --> 00:01:45,319
we are gifting you this premium insurance.

26
00:01:45,480 --> 00:01:46,640
All right.

27
00:01:47,040 --> 00:01:48,680
How do I claim this compensation?

28
00:01:49,120 --> 00:01:50,560
Just follow my instructions.

29
00:02:08,080 --> 00:02:09,479
Why does it keep failing?

30
00:02:09,479 --> 00:02:10,319
I apologize, Ms. Wang.

31
00:02:10,319 --> 00:02:11,319
Please wait a moment.

32
00:02:11,319 --> 00:02:12,479
Let me check for you.

33
00:02:19,280 --> 00:02:20,680
Is it done?

34
00:02:21,800 --> 00:02:23,080
Hello?

35
00:02:23,479 --> 00:02:24,639
Yes, I'm here.

36
00:02:25,039 --> 00:02:26,479
I found the issue.

37
00:02:27,520 --> 00:02:28,919
It seems that your...

38
00:02:29,319 --> 00:02:31,479
credit score is too low.

39
00:02:31,479 --> 00:02:33,039
That's why the application failed.

40
00:02:33,039 --> 00:02:35,439
This might be tied to your spending habits.

41
00:02:35,680 --> 00:02:37,879
Do you usually use a credit card?

42
00:02:37,919 --> 00:02:38,840
Never used one.

43
00:02:38,840 --> 00:02:39,680
That explains it.

44
00:02:39,919 --> 00:02:41,800
Because you rarely use credit for purchases,

45
00:02:41,879 --> 00:02:43,639
your credit score is quite low.

46
00:02:43,879 --> 00:02:44,680
Our company, however,

47
00:02:44,680 --> 00:02:47,000
can recommend a few methods

48
00:02:47,000 --> 00:02:48,840
to help raise your credit score.

49
00:02:48,919 --> 00:02:50,039
This is so annoying.

50
00:02:50,039 --> 00:02:52,120
Why is it such a hassle to claim a thousand bucks?

51
00:02:52,240 --> 00:02:53,280
I don't want the money anymore.

52
00:02:53,599 --> 00:02:54,840
Here's the thing, Ms. Wang.

53
00:02:54,840 --> 00:02:56,719
You still need to think about your child.

54
00:02:56,719 --> 00:02:59,120
If there's a problem with this batch of formula,

55
00:02:59,199 --> 00:03:00,319
I mean, just in case...

56
00:03:00,319 --> 00:03:02,479
If your child happens to get sick,

57
00:03:02,680 --> 00:03:04,080
it will be very difficult to treat.

58
00:03:04,120 --> 00:03:05,120
And as you know,

59
00:03:05,639 --> 00:03:08,439
high medical bills can ruin a family.

60
00:03:13,680 --> 00:03:14,479
Ms. Wang,

61
00:03:15,039 --> 00:03:15,919
for the sake of your child,

62
00:03:16,879 --> 00:03:18,439
please reconsider.

63
00:03:19,680 --> 00:03:20,719
All right.

64
00:03:20,719 --> 00:03:22,599
How do I raise my credit score?

65
00:03:28,919 --> 00:03:29,719
Great, Ms. Wang.

66
00:03:29,719 --> 00:03:31,800
I've sent you a few apps.

67
00:03:31,800 --> 00:03:33,680
They contain a few platforms.

68
00:03:33,680 --> 00:03:35,039
Just apply for a loan limit.

69
00:03:35,199 --> 00:03:36,039
Once the loan is approved,

70
00:03:36,039 --> 00:03:37,240
you can just return the money.

71
00:03:37,240 --> 00:03:37,879
Don't worry,

72
00:03:37,879 --> 00:03:39,879
this app is internal to our company.

73
00:03:40,240 --> 00:03:41,199
We have a business license.

74
00:03:41,479 --> 00:03:43,639
I have to apply for a loan?

75
00:03:43,680 --> 00:03:45,719
You're just applying for a loan limit

76
00:03:45,719 --> 00:03:46,919
to help raise your credit score.

77
00:03:47,280 --> 00:03:49,280
Ms. Wang, trust me.

78
00:03:49,280 --> 00:03:50,319
For your child,

79
00:03:50,599 --> 00:03:52,240
a few taps are worth it.

80
00:03:52,599 --> 00:03:53,439
All right.

81
00:03:59,879 --> 00:04:00,719
Damn it.

82
00:04:21,199 --> 00:04:21,959
Hey, Sun Ming.

83
00:04:22,519 --> 00:04:23,800
Check the message I just sent you.

84
00:04:24,040 --> 00:04:25,319
Notify the victims immediately.

85
00:04:25,639 --> 00:04:27,079
I tampered with their accounts.

86
00:04:27,079 --> 00:04:28,000
They won't receive the money for now.

87
00:04:28,000 --> 00:04:28,959
Got it.

88
00:04:30,839 --> 00:04:31,560
Old man.

89
00:04:32,079 --> 00:04:32,800
Awesome.

90
00:04:47,279 --> 00:04:50,480
The number you have dialed is not in service.

91
00:04:50,519 --> 00:04:52,279
Please check the number and try again.

92
00:04:53,680 --> 00:04:55,480
That woman's husband is an executive.

93
00:04:55,519 --> 00:04:56,480
She's on maternity leave.

94
00:04:56,480 --> 00:04:57,800
Getting her to take a loan was super easy.

95
00:04:58,079 --> 00:04:59,439
Got over 200,000 in one go.

96
00:04:59,439 --> 00:05:00,399
What do you mean?

97
00:05:00,639 --> 00:05:01,560
Maternity leave?

98
00:05:02,279 --> 00:05:03,480
She's pregnant?

99
00:05:03,519 --> 00:05:04,480
So what if she is?

100
00:05:04,680 --> 00:05:05,839
Pregnancy brain makes them easy targets.

101
00:05:05,839 --> 00:05:07,240
Might as well scam her.

102
00:05:07,839 --> 00:05:08,600
Damn.

103
00:05:10,279 --> 00:05:11,680
That's just evil!

104
00:05:16,319 --> 00:05:17,519
Quit whining.

105
00:05:24,279 --> 00:05:26,399
Where did all my money go?

106
00:05:30,079 --> 00:05:31,439
No!

107
00:05:32,439 --> 00:05:35,079
That's the money to raise my baby.

108
00:05:36,079 --> 00:05:37,040
What do I do?

109
00:05:44,040 --> 00:05:44,839
Honey?

110
00:05:46,480 --> 00:05:47,279
What's wrong?

111
00:05:47,279 --> 00:05:51,079
Honey, I got scammed.

112
00:05:51,480 --> 00:05:54,680
All our savings are gone.

113
00:05:55,639 --> 00:05:58,600
And I owe over a hundred thousand in loans.

114
00:05:59,439 --> 00:06:01,199
What were you even thinking?

115
00:06:01,480 --> 00:06:03,839
Haven't I always told you to watch out for scams?

116
00:06:03,839 --> 00:06:05,279
How could you still get scammed?

117
00:06:05,560 --> 00:06:06,959
I'm sorry.

118
00:06:07,800 --> 00:06:10,079
Do you know how hard I work for that money?

119
00:06:10,079 --> 00:06:11,600
What about the baby now?

120
00:06:12,839 --> 00:06:14,759
It's all my fault.

121
00:06:14,759 --> 00:06:15,680
My baby...

122
00:06:15,680 --> 00:06:18,079
Mommy is sorry.

123
00:06:22,720 --> 00:06:25,759
Mom.

124
00:06:27,480 --> 00:06:28,639
Ma'am?

125
00:06:28,639 --> 00:06:29,680
Mom.

126
00:06:30,560 --> 00:06:32,399
Mom.

127
00:06:37,439 --> 00:06:38,240
Mr. Zhou.

128
00:06:38,439 --> 00:06:40,399
Your wife is out of danger for now.

129
00:06:40,839 --> 00:06:42,000
But we couldn't save the baby.

130
00:06:42,399 --> 00:06:43,240
Please take care of yourself.

131
00:06:46,240 --> 00:06:47,040
It's all my fault.

132
00:06:48,720 --> 00:06:50,639
If I hadn't said those things...

133
00:06:52,519 --> 00:06:54,839
My wife wouldn't be like this now.

134
00:06:58,120 --> 00:06:59,360
What do I do now?

135
00:07:00,720 --> 00:07:03,000
Mr. Zhou, don't blame yourself too much.

136
00:07:03,399 --> 00:07:05,959
At the end of the day, it's the scammers' fault.

137
00:07:08,720 --> 00:07:10,199
My baby...

138
00:07:11,240 --> 00:07:12,240
My baby!

139
00:07:14,639 --> 00:07:15,800
Wang Qin, you still have me.

140
00:07:15,800 --> 00:07:16,600
Wang Qin!

141
00:07:17,160 --> 00:07:17,959
Calm down!

142
00:07:18,480 --> 00:07:20,000
Give me back my baby!

143
00:07:24,720 --> 00:07:26,480
Mom...

144
00:07:28,199 --> 00:07:29,959
Mom...

145
00:07:30,839 --> 00:07:31,800
Start resuscitation!

146
00:07:32,160 --> 00:07:33,680
Get a doctor, quick!

147
00:07:36,800 --> 00:07:38,319
Mom!

148
00:07:39,439 --> 00:07:40,959
Mom!

149
00:07:42,319 --> 00:07:44,600
Mom!

150
00:07:57,120 --> 00:07:58,000
What's the situation?

151
00:07:58,839 --> 00:08:00,600
The victim has passed the critical stage,

152
00:08:00,720 --> 00:08:02,959
but due to the miscarriage, she became highly agitated

153
00:08:03,360 --> 00:08:04,160
and went into shock.

154
00:08:07,439 --> 00:08:08,759
So we have evidence now.

155
00:08:08,759 --> 00:08:10,240
Can we arrest him?

156
00:08:17,600 --> 00:08:18,319
Police! Don't move!

157
00:08:21,199 --> 00:08:22,000
Hey, what are you doing?

158
00:08:22,000 --> 00:08:23,319
I'm a law-abiding citizen!

159
00:08:23,319 --> 00:08:24,079
A law-abiding citizen?

160
00:08:24,319 --> 00:08:25,199
You're coming with us.

161
00:08:25,360 --> 00:08:25,839
Take him away.

162
00:08:25,839 --> 00:08:26,439
Yes, sir.

163
00:08:26,439 --> 00:08:27,079
No, wait!

164
00:08:27,839 --> 00:08:28,759
Wait, what's going on here?

165
00:08:35,200 --> 00:08:37,320
Gu Yan, start talking.

166
00:08:41,600 --> 00:08:44,200
Any leads yet?

167
00:08:44,200 --> 00:08:46,519
The phone you provided was reverse-tracked.

168
00:08:46,600 --> 00:08:48,320
All the important data inside has been deleted.

169
00:08:48,519 --> 00:08:49,840
We can't convict Gu Yan.

170
00:08:50,200 --> 00:08:50,960
We have to release him now.

171
00:08:50,960 --> 00:08:52,120
I finally caught the suspect,

172
00:08:52,120 --> 00:08:53,320
and you're just letting him go?

173
00:08:53,639 --> 00:08:54,600
Calm down.

174
00:08:54,720 --> 00:08:55,240
Without evidence,

175
00:08:55,240 --> 00:08:56,200
this is all we can do.

176
00:09:02,559 --> 00:09:03,360
Sun Ming.

177
00:09:04,240 --> 00:09:05,720
You've really disappointed me.

178
00:09:06,840 --> 00:09:08,399
Li Wen, where are you going?

179
00:09:08,399 --> 00:09:09,440
Leave me alone!

180
00:09:30,799 --> 00:09:31,960
I'm a regular at the station.

181
00:09:31,960 --> 00:09:33,120
What could possibly happen?

182
00:09:35,039 --> 00:09:35,960
Ugh, don't ask.

183
00:09:35,960 --> 00:09:36,960
I don't know why, but lately,

184
00:09:36,960 --> 00:09:38,600
I've been targeted by some punk.

185
00:09:40,519 --> 00:09:41,440
Don't worry.

186
00:09:41,440 --> 00:09:42,759
It won't affect you.

187
00:09:43,840 --> 00:09:45,399
Rest assured.

188
00:09:45,399 --> 00:09:45,840
Gotta go.

189
00:10:00,759 --> 00:10:02,799
You just won't leave me alone, will you?

190
00:10:03,960 --> 00:10:04,919
Let me join the organization.

191
00:10:05,000 --> 00:10:05,799
Beat it!

192
00:10:06,120 --> 00:10:07,600
Come on, you saw my skills, right?

193
00:10:07,600 --> 00:10:09,559
I can clone your phone in under a minute.

194
00:10:09,799 --> 00:10:10,840
You guys definitely need me.

195
00:10:12,240 --> 00:10:13,440
So that was you.

196
00:10:14,360 --> 00:10:15,600
You almost got me killed, you know that?

197
00:10:15,600 --> 00:10:16,600
What, you gonna hit me?

198
00:10:16,600 --> 00:10:17,840
Come on, hit me.

199
00:10:18,240 --> 00:10:19,840
If you don't kill me, I'll keep following you.

200
00:10:22,639 --> 00:10:23,639
Let me tell you something.

201
00:10:23,919 --> 00:10:25,120
If I hadn't just...

202
00:10:26,919 --> 00:10:28,519
If I wasn't trying to avoid trouble today,

203
00:10:28,559 --> 00:10:30,840
I wouldn't care if you're some programmer or engineer.

204
00:10:30,919 --> 00:10:31,799
If you really piss us off,

205
00:10:31,799 --> 00:10:33,200
there's nothing we won't do.

206
00:10:33,200 --> 00:10:33,799
Whatever.

207
00:10:34,559 --> 00:10:35,519
Anyway, I've

208
00:10:38,840 --> 00:10:40,039
got my eyes on you.

209
00:10:45,000 --> 00:10:46,600
Scammers use words, not fists.

210
00:11:12,960 --> 00:11:14,000
Sweetie...

211
00:11:15,200 --> 00:11:17,679
Why are you sitting in the dark so late?

212
00:11:17,679 --> 00:11:19,159
Why couldn't I reach your phone?

213
00:11:19,320 --> 00:11:20,360
I tried several times.

214
00:11:21,320 --> 00:11:22,799
I was working overtime.

215
00:11:23,240 --> 00:11:25,000
You know how competitive things are these days.

216
00:11:25,000 --> 00:11:27,200
I have no choice but to work hard.

217
00:11:27,519 --> 00:11:28,080
Really?

218
00:11:28,080 --> 00:11:29,440
Of course it's true.

219
00:11:29,440 --> 00:11:31,200
You think I want to work overtime?

220
00:11:31,200 --> 00:11:33,600
I'd much rather spend every day with my sweetheart.

221
00:11:36,840 --> 00:11:37,639
You were smoking again.

222
00:11:38,759 --> 00:11:39,480
No.

223
00:11:39,480 --> 00:11:41,000
I really didn't.

224
00:11:41,720 --> 00:11:43,200
It's those heavy smokers at work.

225
00:11:43,200 --> 00:11:44,200
I yell at them every day.

226
00:11:44,200 --> 00:11:45,679
They're just so inconsiderate.

227
00:11:46,399 --> 00:11:47,039
Fine.

228
00:11:47,039 --> 00:11:48,000
Your food is in the pot.

229
00:11:48,000 --> 00:11:49,039
Go to bed early after you eat.

230
00:11:52,039 --> 00:11:53,240
I'm so touched.

231
00:11:53,759 --> 00:11:54,720
Give Dad a hug.

232
00:11:55,679 --> 00:11:56,440
You're filthy.

233
00:11:56,440 --> 00:11:57,600
Take a shower as soon as you eat.

234
00:11:57,600 --> 00:11:58,240
I'm going to sleep.

235
00:11:58,240 --> 00:11:59,120
Okay.

236
00:12:01,639 --> 00:12:03,039
Sweet dreams.

237
00:12:12,000 --> 00:12:13,000
This girl...

238
00:12:15,440 --> 00:12:16,720
She's keeping tabs on me now.

239
00:12:19,840 --> 00:12:22,240
Let's see if I can find some evidence on Gu Yan's phone.

240
00:12:38,879 --> 00:12:40,519
Why is this phone so clean?

241
00:13:00,360 --> 00:13:02,000
Who is she?

242
00:13:08,720 --> 00:13:11,039
Why are there so few photos on her social media?

243
00:13:16,919 --> 00:13:18,840
Looks like Gu Yan is intentionally protecting her.

244
00:13:19,440 --> 00:13:22,519
Maybe we can find some clues through her.
